Luxação e instabilidade do ombro — INTO (@med-source-into-instability: 0, is #reference, #part-of @medicine-sources) { r_7B33CEPJHRFH5DCM9YKY91Z73C
Instituto Nacional de Traumatologia e Ortopedia Jamil Haddad, Ministério da Saúde. Luxação e Instabilidade do Ombro. Português brasileiro.

[Authorized source](https://www.into.saude.gov.br/lista-dicas-dos-especialistas/187-ombro/275-luxacao-e-instabilidade-do-ombro).

A Brazilian public introduction to dislocation and instability. Pair its accessible explanation with the anatomical and clinical distinctions in the guide. Do not use a reading or video to attempt joint reduction.

